@page id="bk-super" rh="BACK MATTER · SUPERSEDED AND IN CONFLICT" m="SUPERSEDED; CONFLICT"
# What no longer controls, and where the files disagree
rec:
SUPERSEDED · the old companion's Prelate | Page 182 of the old companion marked "Prelate Huldah's office" as canon. FR 33 renamed the Prelate. Huldah is only the biblical prophet.
SUPERSEDED · Solomon at thirteen | The timeline's age. DECIDED: sixteen.
SUPERSEDED · Dorian at 61 | The Crownward file's age. The ruling uses 59.
SUPERSEDED · Crest as Dorian's father | The Crownward file. Under FR 35, his uncle.
SUPERSEDED · four phases | The original Trials file's Public Season and Declaration phases. The updated file has three.
CONFLICT · the Commonwife quotas | Introduced under Crest in 2062 (TL), piloted in Red Earth in 2058 (DOM). INFERENCE: A pilot under Elias, made Empire-wide under Crest.
CONFLICT · Sera Callum's origin | "The Northern Dominion" (TL). No Dominion has that name.
corr: Corrections to the old companion's research run through every part, each printed where it falls under the heading "Correction to the old companion."
prompt: A conflict I've found since this printing | fill

